## Interface: 16001
## Title: ProfessionsForever
## Notes: A skinnable professions window for WoW: Forever with bag, bank and alt awareness, a crafting queue, shopping list with Auctionator pricing, alt transfer planner, recipe cooldowns, and navigation to vendors, trainers and bankers.
